      {
         "id": "SECTION_rules",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "<p><h3>General rules</h3>The table below shows the numbers from 0 to 99 arranged in 10 columns and 10 lines. In each line, one number is missing. Your goal is to click on the empty space of each line to see the number that should be there. When you reveal all the missing numbers, you will receive a congratulations message.</p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_game",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "<p><h3>Missing numbers</h3>Click on the empty spaces to reveal the missing numbers. When you finish, you can start again by clicking the button <input id=\"playButton\" type=\"button\" />.</p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p><table id=\"missingNum\" class=\"tableTen tableTenBgBlue\"><tr><th colspan=\"10\"><i>Number sequence</i></th></tr> </table></p><p id=\"missingCongrats\" class=\"desc\" style=\"display: none;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-medal\" style=\"color: gold;\"></i> Congratulations! You revealed all the missing numbers!</p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\">The table is based on the number sequence presented in <i>Numerical families (Part I)</i> (<htcite0>).</p>",
